    <string name="privacy_policy_text">&lt;b&gt;FINANZAPP PRIVACY POLICY&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
        At &lt;b&gt;FinanzApp&lt;/b&gt;, your family\'s privacy is our priority. This application has been designed under principles of transparency and security.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
        &lt;b&gt;1. DATA WE COLLECT&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
        We collect basic data from your Google profile (name, email, and photo) to identify you within your family unit. We also store the financial transactions and accounts you register voluntarily.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
        &lt;b&gt;2. PURPOSE OF TREATMENT&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
        Your data is used exclusively to allow the operation of shared finances. We do not sell or share your data with third parties outside of the Google Cloud services necessary for the app.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
        &lt;b&gt;3. SECURITY AND STORAGE&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
        The information is stored in &lt;b&gt;Google Cloud (Firestore)&lt;/b&gt;, which has advanced encryption protocols at rest and in transit. Access is restricted only to your family members through security rules validated on the server.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
        &lt;b&gt;4. YOUR RIGHTS&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
        As a user, you have the right to access, rectification, deletion, portability, limitation, and opposition over your data. Specifically, from the app itself you can:&lt;br/&gt;
        • &lt;b&gt;Access:&lt;/b&gt; Consult your data at any time.&lt;br/&gt;
        • &lt;b&gt;Rectification:&lt;/b&gt; Correct your name or photo from your Google profile.&lt;br/&gt;
        • &lt;b&gt;Portability:&lt;/b&gt; Download your information in JSON format from Settings.&lt;br/&gt;
        • &lt;b&gt;Deletion:&lt;/b&gt; Permanently delete your account and all associated data.&lt;br/&gt;
        To exercise the limitation or opposition of treatment, or any other request, write to us at: davidlucasmora81@gmail.com.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
        You can consult the full policy, with the identity of the data controller and all legal details, at: &lt;b&gt;[Privacy Policy Public URL once published]&lt;/b&gt;.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
        By continuing, you confirm that you have read and accept that FinanzApp processes your data according to these terms.</string>
